From ca9012e829e088f9640abc16bce5f8370731bf3f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 13:35:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 504/572] fix(st): cast clk_get_rate return when setting
 console

The return of clk_get_rate() is an unsigned long. But for console, it
will never be above 4GHz, so it is safe to cast it to uint32_t, before
passing the parameter to set_console().

This corrects the warning:
plat/st/common/stm32mp_common.c:303:13: warning: implicit conversion
 loses integer precision: 'unsigned long' to 'uint32_t' (aka 'unsigned
 int')
      [-Wshorten-64-to-32]
  303 |         clk_rate =
		 	clk_get_rate((unsigned long)dt_uart_info.clock);
      |                 ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git f407e209f0c19c7860b22137a9df763629c10aa8 fix(st): cast clk_get_rate return when setting console]
Change-Id: I4c66f31ce5c002f39ffd8811fdf50496aa46f39d
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/572144
Tested-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
---
 plat/st/common/stm32mp_common.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/plat/st/common/stm32mp_common.c b/plat/st/common/stm32mp_common.c
index 2b58b6cfb0..c56ef7ff6b 100644
--- a/plat/st/common/stm32mp_common.c
+++ b/plat/st/common/stm32mp_common.c
@@ -393,7 +393,7 @@ int stm32mp_uart_console_setup(void)
 
 	reset_uart((uint32_t)dt_uart_info.reset);
 
-	clk_rate = clk_get_rate((unsigned long)dt_uart_info.clock);
+	clk_rate = (uint32_t)clk_get_rate((unsigned long)dt_uart_info.clock);
 #endif
 
 	set_console(dt_uart_info.base, clk_rate);
-- 
